      "side": 1,
      "message": "get_battery_type() relies on manuf_name to identify the battery. If you use manuf_name from C436, how does the manuf_name match work?\n\nReference: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/refs/heads/master/common/battery_fuel_gauge.c#19",
